            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Added
- **Claude: a row tells you when your next message will cost more.** Claude
  keeps your conversation cached for about an hour. Once a session has sat
  that long, idle or waiting on you, the cache is gone, and your next message
  pays to rebuild it. The row now says so: "cache cold · 39k to rebuild".
- **Claude: sessions in fast mode say "fast"** next to the model.
]]></description>
